sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Express Server
    participant D as Data Files

    B->>S: GET /api/risks
    S->>D: Read 58 signal JSONs
    D-->>S: Risk scores + locations
    S-->>B: JSON array

    B->>S: GET /api/highways
    S->>D: Read highways.json
    D-->>S: 8 highway routes
    S-->>B: JSON object

    B->>S: GET /ca-counties.geojson
    S-->>B: GeoJSON boundaries

    Note over B: Render map with county polygons + highways

    B->>B: User clicks county
    Note over B: Update right panel and evidence chain

    B->>B: User clicks highway
    Note over B: Show segment risk and county breakdown
